Content-Type: text/plain; charset=utf-8

A message already moved into cur/ (the maildir "seen" state), per the standard cur/new/tmp
layout. The real maildir spec appends ",S=<size>:2,<flags>" to a cur/ filename, but a literal
colon is not a legal Windows filename character, so this fixture omits that suffix - the
walk/enumerator only needs to know the file lives under cur/, not parse its flags.
